  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>THE BASICS - this is all you need</b>

    WASD to move, Space to jump,
    mouse to look.

    Left mouse fires, right mouse aims, R reloads, 1-3 swap weapons.

    Rounds
    are elimination: no respawn until the round ends. First team to the round target
    wins.


    <b>OPTIONAL - the movement tech</b>

    Hold a direction, jump,
    and steer with the mouse to keep the speed you built.

    Chain jumps the instant
    you land and you keep your momentum instead of scrubbing it off.

    None of
    this is required to win a gunfight - it is a way to reach a fight first.


    <b>COMEBACK</b>

    The
    team that lost the previous round spawns with bonus armour.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
